    "conservation": "abs(abs(Qout)-abs(Qin))/max(abs(Qin),abs(Qout)).",
    "velocityProfile": "At the solver-VTK axial cell-centroid plane nearest x=L/2, compare cell-centred Ux to 2*Umean*(1-(y^2+z^2)/R^2). Relative L2 is the unweighted cell-centroid RMS error divided by the analytic cell-centroid RMS. Relative Linf is max absolute error divided by analytic centerline velocity. Transverse ratio is RMS(sqrt(Uy^2+Uz^2))/RMS(abs(Ux)).",
